@prefix autofde: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/autofde/ontology#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


# Runtime, authority, hooks, and BRCE
#################################################################

autofde:Actor a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Subject a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Operation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Environment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Policy a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Approval a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:AuthorityClass a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .
autofde:AuthorityGrant a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:AuthorityIntersection a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:BRCEBroker a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Capability .
autofde:BoundedAction a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Actuation .
autofde:KnowledgeHook a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Capability .
autofde:AgentSession a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:Signal a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Observation .
autofde:BreachObservation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Signal .
autofde:Decision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:OperationalRevision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:ProcessCommitment .
autofde:DeliveryRevision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:PhaseGraph .
autofde:PromotionDecision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .

#################################################################
